Package: penduloom
Title: Interactive Kinematic Pendulum Simulations
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Conor", "Neilson", email = "hello@conorneilson.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Penduloom Team [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Penduloom Team <hello@example.com>
Description: A Shiny application for exploring chained pendulums with
    configurable joint counts, arm lengths, and angular velocities. R calculates rolling trajectory batches while the browser
    interpolates and renders them for smooth motion.
